==French==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|fr|nrf|caillou}}, of uncertain origin, but probably related to {{der|fr|fro|gal|t=small pebble}}, which could be of {{der|fr|cel|-}}/{{der|fr|cel-gau|-}} origin.

Compare {{cog|pcd|cailleu}}, {{cog|wa|caie}}; also {{cog|nl|kei||stone, rock}}.

